+        *   Log loss and PSNR every $I_{print}$ steps [S14, unofficial].
+        *   Render validation images every $I_{img}$ steps [S14, unofficial].
+        *   Save model checkpoint every $I_{weights}$ steps [S14, unofficial].
 
